498	\begin{lemma}[The affine models lie over \(k\)]
499	  \label{lem:P1_chartIota_structureMap}
500	  \lean{AlgebraicGeometry.P1.chartι_structureMap}
501	  \uses{def:P1_chartIota, def:P1_structureMap}
502	  \leanok
503	  The composite \(\Spec A_{(X_i)} \to \PP^1 \to \Spec k\) is the morphism induced by the
504	  \(k\)-algebra structure of \(A_{(X_i)}\); that is, the affine models are morphisms of
505	  schemes over \(k\).
